      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Where countless soldiers perished helplessly\r\nagainst the Shadow Master's strange attacks,\r\nyou broke through with that war mission!\r\nYou've changed the tides of war, Arisen.",
        "Jp" : "闇の将の得体の知れぬ攻撃には\r\nなすすべもなく散っていった兵も数知れず――\r\nそこを覚者様が突破してくださって\r\n一気に戦況が変わった、ウォーミッションですね！"
